@host = http://localhost:5277
@token = paste-token-from-login-here

### Log in as the seeded admin (Development only)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@library.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

### List books
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Books?page=1&pageSize=20

### Search books
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Books/search?term=1984

### List genres
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Genres

### Create a genre (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Genres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Science Fiction", "description": "Speculative fiction" }

### Borrow the seeded book "1984" (any signed-in user)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Books/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/borrow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My loans
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Loans/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Return a loan (replace the id)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Loans/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overdue loans (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Loans/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

